    "_note": "PHANTASIE III (boot program): ICE DRAGON on hi-res page 1, a FOR-loop pause, then the 7 rows of 'HIT ANY KEY TO CONTINUE' POKEd in (lines 245-290) and a wait for a key; a key at any point goes on (GOSUB 300). The pauses are BASIC FOR loops (time not decoded [?]): only the last screen is shown, until a key.",
